  "ruleText": "Ed 504.07 Certification as a Paraeducator I. To be certified as a Paraeducator I, an individual shall possess a high school degree or HiSET equivalent.\n\nSource. #8667, eff 7-1-06, EXPIRED: 7-1-14\n\nNew. #12143, eff 3-24-17; renumbered by #12661 (formerly Ed 504.06)",
